# The image copies only these (Dockerfile); everything else -- .venv*, .git,
# .dev-data, reports -- would only slow the build context upload. `frontend/`
# is admitted whole for the build stage, then stripped of its dev-only trees:
# tests, fixtures, Playwright output and node_modules never reach even that
# stage, and no runtime image copies Node, npm or a frontend source file at all
# (Dockerfile decision 1: the build stage is discarded, only `dist/` survives).
*
!requirements.txt
!server/
!methodology/
!vendor/
!frontend/
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
frontend/dist-demo
frontend/tests
frontend/fixtures
frontend/playwright-report
frontend/test-results
frontend/a11y-results
**/__pycache__
